# V2 model foundation uses the same server-only variables above.
# Verified model: gpt-5.6-terra, reasoning effort fixed to low, SDK retries 0.
# V2 native research uses the same OpenAI key; hosted tool calls capped at 2.
# Internal query/page/byte counts are provider-managed, not independently capped.
# See docs/decisions/langgraph-v2.md; no extra search key is required.
# RUN_V2_PROVIDER_PROBE=1 enables the manual SDK compatibility probes.
# RUN_V2_NATIVE_ADAPTER_PROBE=1 enables the billable production adapter smoke test.
